                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Time to sit and listen to A Fisherman's Tale.\nA short VR game with a neat story, I expected it to be a bit longer (took me about an hour to beat) but it's still very good, the puzzles and visuals are swell and I experienced only one bug that made me restart (You can restart from the beginning of each chapter and they aren't very long)\nIncludes a great overarching metaphor/message, also very French.\nWould recommend",
